The '''Feathered Letter''' is provided as an objective for {{questlong|Alliance|1|Feathered Letter (quest)|Feathered Letter|race=HighElf|class=hunter}}.

==Contains==
{{Book|content=
I greet you, fellow ranger-in-training. I appreciate the way you carry yourself and the determination you demonstrate in following the footsteps of our renowned brethren.

Before the fall of [[Quel'Thalas]], I was a freshly inducted member of the [[Farstriders]], a contingent of skilled rangers who ventured beyond our borders to guard our lands and honor. The legacy of the Farstriders has been diminished during these trying times. However, I believe we can restore it, albeit gradually, together. Meet with me; I will be somewhere in the outskirts of [[Brinthilien]].
}}

